{
  "tema": 6597,
  "slug": "acabar-terminar-por",
  "titulo": "Acabar / terminar + por infinitive or + gerund: to end up doing something",
  "subtitulo": "Acabó por ceder / terminó cediendo: how it all ended.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "To end up doing: acabar / terminar + por + infinitive, or acabar / terminar + gerund (no preposition). Same meaning.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _to end up doing_ something, Spanish has four ways, all with the same meaning:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Pattern",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "acabar + por + infinitive",
              "Acabó por regalarle un anillo."
            ],
            [
              "terminar + por + infinitive",
              "Terminó por dejarlo."
            ],
            [
              "acabar + gerund",
              "Acabó llorando."
            ],
            [
              "terminar + gerund",
              "Terminó obedeciendo."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "With the **infinitive**, use **por**. With the **gerund**, no preposition at all."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It works in different tenses: **acabarás por entenderlo**, **siempre termino comiendo tacos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **por** + infinitive, or straight to the gerund. Never mix them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Ella era tan exigente que él ==acabó por regalarle== un anillo.",
              "en": "She was so demanding that he ended up giving her a ring."
            },
            {
              "es": "Después de diez años juntos, ella ==terminó por dejarlo==.",
              "en": "After ten years together, she ended up leaving him."
            },
            {
              "es": "Carlos ==acabó llorando== por el estrés del trabajo.",
              "en": "Carlos ended up crying because of stress at work."
            },
            {
              "es": "Laura ==terminó obedeciendo== a su papá.",
              "en": "Laura ended up obeying her dad."
            },
            {
              "es": "Siempre ==terminamos comiendo== tacos en la madrugada.",
              "en": "We always end up eating tacos in the early morning."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Acabarás por entenderlo==.",
              "en": "You'll end up understanding it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Terminó por llorando."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Terminó llorando."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Terminó por llorar."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "**Por** goes with the infinitive only."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Acabó llorar."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Acabó por llorar."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Infinitive needs **por**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Acabo de comer."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "**Acabar de** is different: _to have just done_. See [[6508|acabar de]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
